      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Self-contained – 1 Bedroom Apartments\r\nNo 10 Court St, Enniscorthy, Co Wexford is ideally located, just off the town centre in a nice area. The property consists of 3 No.  x 1-bedroom self-contained apartments spread over three floors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Apartment No 1:\r\nHall: 1.5 x 1.3m. Tiled floors\r\nLiving Room: 3.4 x 3.2m. Laminated wooden floor.\r\nKitchen: 2.5 x 2.25m. Tiled floors, fitted units, cooker, pvc cladding on walls.\r\nUtility room: 2.73 x 1.15m. Tiled floors, fitted units, back door.\r\nBedroom: 3.5 x 2.7m. Wooden floor\r\nShower room: 2.15 x 2m. Tiled Floors, tiled walls, pvc cladding on walls, WC, WHB, Free standing shower, plumber for washing machine. \r\nApartment No 2:\r\nHall: 2.4 x 2m. Tiled floors.\r\nLiving Room: 4.1 x 3.44m. Carpet, feature fireplace.\r\nKitchen: 3.6 x 2m. Tiled floors, fitted units, cooker, washing machine, fridge.\r\nBedroom: 2.65 x 3.28m. Carpet, Fitted wardrobe.\r\nShower room:  2.15 x 1.6m. Tiled floors, Tiled walls, WC, WHB, Free standing shower.\r\nApartment No 3:\r\nHall: 1 x 2m. Tiled floors.\r\nOpen plan Living Room/Kitchen: 6 x 3.3m. Wooden Floors, fitted units, plumber for washing machine. \r\nBedroom: 4.4 x 2.5m. Wooden floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\nShower room: 2.25 x 1m. Tiled Floors, Tiled walls, WC, WHB, Free standing shower, plumber for washing machine."
      },
